.*
.* The help search index: F11 in help asks for words, then lists the
.* topics of the panel group's *SCHIDX they find. The dialog engine
.* fills TOPICS and shows a topic's help module for option 5.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=WORDSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TOPICCL BASETYPE='CHAR 70'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=SCHIDX CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=WORDS CLASS=WORDSCL.
:VAR NAME=TOPIC CLASS=TOPICCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=TOPICS VARS='OPT TOPIC'.
:KEYL NAME=SCHKEYS HELP=SCHKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit help
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=SEARCH KEYL=SCHKEYS HELP=SEARCH ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Search Help Index
:TOPINST.Type the words to look for, press Enter.  Leave them blank for every topic.
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATAI VAR=SCHIDX USAGE=OUTPUT.Search index
:DATAI VAR=WORDS USAGE=INPUT HELP=WORDS.Words to search for
:EDATA.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=TOPICS KEYL=SCHKEYS HELP=TOPICS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Search Help Index
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=TOPICS.No topic has these words.
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 5'.5=Display topic
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=TOPIC USAGE=OUTPUT.Topic
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=SEARCH.Search Help Index
:P.The help of a panel group can be gathered in a search index. Type
one or more words here; the topics whose index words begin with any
of them are listed next, and option 5 shows a topic's help.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=WORDS.Words to search for
:P.One or more words, separated by blanks. A topic is listed when one
of its index words begins with one of them.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=TOPICS.Search Help Index topics
:P.The topics found. Type 5 next to a topic and press Enter to read
its help; F12 goes back to the words.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=SCHKEYS.Function keys
:P.F3 leaves help, F12 goes back one display.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
